[{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l017","ordinal":165377,"en":"No one but you"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l018","ordinal":165378,"en":"Is suited for it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l019","ordinal":165379,"en":"With your beard pure white,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l020","ordinal":165380,"en":"You yourself are fit for the contest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l021","ordinal":165381,"en":"Uncle, when your journey is near,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l022","ordinal":165382,"en":"Wrestle Zholoy for us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l023","ordinal":165383,"en":"Win us the great honor, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l024","ordinal":165384,"en":"Of the towering black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l025","ordinal":165385,"en":"Go see his full strength, uncle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l026","ordinal":165386,"en":"Let him seize his former fury;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l027","ordinal":165387,"en":"If he falls into your hands, tear him apart, uncle!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l028","ordinal":165388,"en":"Swing and hook him, uncle;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l029","ordinal":165389,"en":"Seize him from the inside, uncle!\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l030","ordinal":165390,"en":"Then Koshoy said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l031","ordinal":165391,"en":"\"When, grown old, I could not"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l032","ordinal":165392,"en":"Lie in warmth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l033","ordinal":165393,"en":"When the cuffs of my trousers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l034","ordinal":165394,"en":"Would not fit my legs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l035","ordinal":165395,"en":"You met me when I suffered"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l036","ordinal":165396,"en":"The humiliation of eighty-five;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l037","ordinal":165397,"en":"You met me when I had seen"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l038","ordinal":165398,"en":"The far side of life."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b003:l039","ordinal":165399,"en":"I too, my colt Manas—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l001","ordinal":165400,"en":"When drunk from drinking arak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l002","ordinal":165401,"en":"When young and sound in mind,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l003","ordinal":165402,"en":"When my body was full,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l004","ordinal":165403,"en":"When hellish old age was absent,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l005","ordinal":165404,"en":"When my patterned spear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l006","ordinal":165405,"en":"Smoked in my hand,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l007","ordinal":165406,"en":"When infidel and Muslim alike"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l008","ordinal":165407,"en":"Jostled before me—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l009","ordinal":165408,"en":"Why did I not die on a mountain pass?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l010","ordinal":165409,"en":"The sprawling city of Beijing—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l011","ordinal":165410,"en":"When I besieged it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l012","ordinal":165411,"en":"Its kalday and duushu—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l013","ordinal":165412,"en":"When I beat them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l014","ordinal":165413,"en":"Making their ingots clatter,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l015","ordinal":165414,"en":"When I took them away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l016","ordinal":165415,"en":"Why did I not die there?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l017","ordinal":165416,"en":"Against darkened Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l018","ordinal":165417,"en":"When we exchanged blows,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l019","ordinal":165418,"en":"Over Bilerik,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l020","ordinal":165419,"en":"Fighting so many days,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l021","ordinal":165420,"en":"Captive Bilerik—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l022","ordinal":165421,"en":"When I pulled him from his place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l023","ordinal":165422,"en":"Ezkara, khan of the Manchus—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l024","ordinal":165423,"en":"When I pulled him from his hands,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l025","ordinal":165424,"en":"Why did I not die then?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l026","ordinal":165425,"en":"Eighty-five is an old age;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l027","ordinal":165426,"en":"Your extreme aging"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l028","ordinal":165427,"en":"Is the wrath of the one God."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l029","ordinal":165428,"en":"Go down against the champion yourself, Manas!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l030","ordinal":165429,"en":"When my whole body was sound,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l031","ordinal":165430,"en":"When old age was not upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l032","ordinal":165431,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l033","ordinal":165432,"en":"Twenty-five passed by;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l034","ordinal":165433,"en":"Dear time, when the earth trembled!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l035","ordinal":165434,"en":"If my calves were firm as a child's,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l036","ordinal":165435,"en":"If decrepitude were not upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l037","ordinal":165436,"en":"Would I not grapple with Zholoy?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l038","ordinal":165437,"en":"However much Koshoy refused,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1156:b004:l039","ordinal":165438,"en":"Tiger Manas would not relent."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l001","ordinal":165439,"en":"Koshoy of the Katagan—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l002","ordinal":165440,"en":"He took him out to the champion:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l003","ordinal":165441,"en":"If he won, he would take honor;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l004","ordinal":165442,"en":"If he fell, they would stand watching."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l005","ordinal":165443,"en":"As the tale of the honorable people tells,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l006","ordinal":165444,"en":"Your uncle went out to the champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l007","ordinal":165445,"en":"\"Go out yourself, Manas,\" said Koshoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l008","ordinal":165446,"en":"Pleading as he stood."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l009","ordinal":165447,"en":"These were Manas's words:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l010","ordinal":165448,"en":"\"When my father Zhakyp pursued,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l011","ordinal":165449,"en":"When my mother Chyiyrdy gave birth,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l012","ordinal":165450,"en":"I grew to maturity and became a man, Koshoy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l013","ordinal":165451,"en":"And became equal to a hero's son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l014","ordinal":165452,"en":"Since Manas became Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l015","ordinal":165453,"en":"Since fortune settled upon my head,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l016","ordinal":165454,"en":"Since I mounted a horse astride"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l017","ordinal":165455,"en":"And donned the coat Akolpok,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l018","ordinal":165456,"en":"Many gathered together;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l019","ordinal":165457,"en":"I had no ax for a man on foot."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l020","ordinal":165458,"en":"Once mounted on a horse,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l021","ordinal":165459,"en":"I was more skillful than an intriguer,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l022","ordinal":165460,"en":"Mightier than a brave man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l023","ordinal":165461,"en":"Send me against a claimant in debate;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l024","ordinal":165462,"en":"Send me against a spear-bearing enemy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l025","ordinal":165463,"en":"Send me against a foe who closes knee to knee;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l026","ordinal":165464,"en":"Send me against an enemy who draws rein to rein."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l027","ordinal":165465,"en":"If I do not level my spear and thrust,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b003:l028","ordinal":165466,"en":"Then my eyes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l001","ordinal":165467,"en":"Cast them to the flank where whips are traded;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l002","ordinal":165468,"en":"Cast me into the black-burning fire.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l003","ordinal":165469,"en":"Then Koshoy heeded his words"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l004","ordinal":165470,"en":"And stepped out to the champion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l005","ordinal":165471,"en":"Speaking many words in a ringing voice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l006","ordinal":165472,"en":"Your uncle entered into grief:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l007","ordinal":165473,"en":"\"Eighty-five is an age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l008","ordinal":165474,"en":"The humiliation of a living man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l009","ordinal":165475,"en":"Rather than live on like a mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l010","ordinal":165476,"en":"It is better for a man to lie in a mound."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l011","ordinal":165477,"en":"Had I met the Kalmyk at sixty,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l012","ordinal":165478,"en":"Would I not have taken him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l013","ordinal":165479,"en":"Had I met him at seventy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l014","ordinal":165480,"en":"Would I not have thrown him?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l015","ordinal":165481,"en":"When I speak, I have sorrow and grief;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l016","ordinal":165482,"en":"Magnanimous Manas, hear me."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l017","ordinal":165483,"en":"The hides of forty ibex—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l018","ordinal":165484,"en":"I have my kyldyrama trousers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l019","ordinal":165485,"en":"When jostling in combat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l020","ordinal":165486,"en":"With a dog who boasts of strength,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l021","ordinal":165487,"en":"If that enraged pig seizes them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l022","ordinal":165488,"en":"My trousers will split,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l023","ordinal":165489,"en":"And your uncle's shame will show openly."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l024","ordinal":165490,"en":"His splendor will spill like ashes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l025","ordinal":165491,"en":"In your uncle's old age,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l026","ordinal":165492,"en":"His face will change from shame;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l027","ordinal":165493,"en":"Because of the sprawling black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1157:b004:l028","ordinal":165494,"en":"Your uncle will fall.\""},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l001","ordinal":165495,"en":"Koshoy's white beard gleamed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l002","ordinal":165496,"en":"Your uncle Koshoy spoke loudly"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l003","ordinal":165497,"en":"And stopped as he turned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l004","ordinal":165498,"en":"Your mighty uncle Koshoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l005","ordinal":165499,"en":"Lamented his former days:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l006","ordinal":165500,"en":"\"Hey, Khan Manas, my colt!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l007","ordinal":165501,"en":"When drunk from drinking arak,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l008","ordinal":165502,"en":"When young and light-minded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l009","ordinal":165503,"en":"Barefoot and bareheaded,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l010","ordinal":165504,"en":"At twenty-five, when the earth trembled,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l011","ordinal":165505,"en":"Dear youth passed away."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l012","ordinal":165506,"en":"Eighty-five is a mighty burden,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l013","ordinal":165507,"en":"The humiliation of a living man."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l014","ordinal":165508,"en":"Rather than live excessively long,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l015","ordinal":165509,"en":"It is better that the Most High God"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l016","ordinal":165510,"en":"Should take what he created."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l017","ordinal":165511,"en":"Once we besieged"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l018","ordinal":165512,"en":"His sprawling city;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l019","ordinal":165513,"en":"Once we beat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l020","ordinal":165514,"en":"Its kalday and ambal."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l021","ordinal":165515,"en":"When we beat them—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l022","ordinal":165516,"en":"Counting now, that time has passed;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l023","ordinal":165517,"en":"Staggering as with yellow sickness,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l024","ordinal":165518,"en":"Old age has arrived."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l025","ordinal":165519,"en":"My colt, tiger Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l026","ordinal":165520,"en":"My joints have loosened,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l027","ordinal":165521,"en":"My eyes glint with pus,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l028","ordinal":165522,"en":"My waist has stooped downward;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l029","ordinal":165523,"en":"Bastard old age"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l030","ordinal":165524,"en":"Has mounted me with jutting laziness."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l031","ordinal":165525,"en":"All my joints creak;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l032","ordinal":165526,"en":"In the whiteness of my beard,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l033","ordinal":165527,"en":"You have laid a burden upon me, Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l034","ordinal":165528,"en":"Saying, 'Wrestle this infidel.'"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l035","ordinal":165529,"en":"When my journey is near,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l036","ordinal":165530,"en":"My eyes stare dimly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b004:l037","ordinal":165531,"en":"And my joints tremble."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l001","ordinal":165532,"en":"When I speak, Manas, I have grief:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l002","ordinal":165533,"en":"The hides of forty wild asses,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l003","ordinal":165534,"en":"Joined together and made—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l004","ordinal":165535,"en":"I have kyldyrama trousers."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l005","ordinal":165536,"en":"Great Zholoy of the Kalmyks—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l006","ordinal":165537,"en":"If I wrestle him, they will split,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l007","ordinal":165538,"en":"And before the people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l008","ordinal":165539,"en":"Your uncle's nakedness will show."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l009","ordinal":165540,"en":"The honor of your elder Koshoy"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l010","ordinal":165541,"en":"Will spill like ashes."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l011","ordinal":165542,"en":"His cry will reach God;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l012","ordinal":165543,"en":"Your poor uncle will fall."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l013","ordinal":165544,"en":"Will he not see the onlookers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l014","ordinal":165545,"en":"If my shame appears,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l015","ordinal":165546,"en":"Will your uncle not die before his time?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l016","ordinal":165547,"en":"Will the Kalmyk not split my trousers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l017","ordinal":165548,"en":"Driven beyond all means,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l018","ordinal":165549,"en":"Will your uncle not die before his time?!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l019","ordinal":165550,"en":"Zholoy of the Kalmyks—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l020","ordinal":165551,"en":"Looking at him, he is a huge giant;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l021","ordinal":165552,"en":"Among the black Kalmyk people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l022","ordinal":165553,"en":"That bastard is their master."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l023","ordinal":165554,"en":"Thick-wristed and stone-hearted,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l024","ordinal":165555,"en":"Such is Zholoy's nature."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l025","ordinal":165556,"en":"The broad-limbed brute"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l026","ordinal":165557,"en":"My worthless trousers—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l027","ordinal":165558,"en":"Will he not seize them by their cuffs,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l028","ordinal":165559,"en":"Tear all my trousers,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l029","ordinal":165560,"en":"And before the people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l030","ordinal":165561,"en":"Leave your uncle like carrion."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l031","ordinal":165562,"en":"Will he not see the infidel's strength?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l032","ordinal":165563,"en":"If they grapple, will he not split the trousers?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l033","ordinal":165564,"en":"Your uncle, the people's lament,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l034","ordinal":165565,"en":"Will he not die before his time?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l035","ordinal":165566,"en":"The black Kalmyk and Manchu people"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l036","ordinal":165567,"en":"Have surely gathered."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1158:b005:l037","ordinal":165568,"en":"Kökötöy's many prizes—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l001","ordinal":165569,"en":"Would the Kalmyks not take them and return?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l002","ordinal":165570,"en":"Would the Muslims' pride not be broken?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l003","ordinal":165571,"en":"Would the Black Kalmyks and Manchus not say,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l004","ordinal":165572,"en":"“We have thrown down their khan,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l005","ordinal":165573,"en":"And would God not utterly strike us?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l006","ordinal":165574,"en":"Before the lumbering Joloy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l007","ordinal":165575,"en":"I have no trousers on my backside;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l008","ordinal":165576,"en":"How can I go to him with them bristling bare?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l009","ordinal":165577,"en":"Before that hulking Black Kalmyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l010","ordinal":165578,"en":"How can I grapple body to body?”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l011","ordinal":165579,"en":"Your dear elder, Khan Koshoi,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l012","ordinal":165580,"en":"Made his meaning known in all these words,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l013","ordinal":165581,"en":"And then your elder Khan Koshoi stood there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l014","ordinal":165582,"en":"Koshoi of the Katagan"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l015","ordinal":165583,"en":"Had been matched against the wrestler:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l016","ordinal":165584,"en":"If he threw him, he would win the prize;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l017","ordinal":165585,"en":"If he fell, he would be left with nothing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l018","ordinal":165586,"en":"Your elder's lament"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l019","ordinal":165587,"en":"The lion Manas heard."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l020","ordinal":165588,"en":"As soon as the leopard heard it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l021","ordinal":165589,"en":"From atop his saddle,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l022","ordinal":165590,"en":"From beneath his saddle cushion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l023","ordinal":165591,"en":"Bloodthirsty Manas, that noble lion,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l024","ordinal":165592,"en":"Said, “Let my elder wear these when he grapples,”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l025","ordinal":165593,"en":"The splendid, finely made kandagai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l026","ordinal":165594,"en":"He took out there."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l027","ordinal":165595,"en":"Manas's splendid wife Kanykei,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l028","ordinal":165596,"en":"A strong maid almost like a saint,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l029","ordinal":165597,"en":"Had lined its inside with brocade;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l030","ordinal":165598,"en":"Sixty young wives gathered"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l031","ordinal":165599,"en":"And worked on it through the nights."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l032","ordinal":165600,"en":"She had the whole earth searched,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l033","ordinal":165601,"en":"And had mountain goats from the high mountains"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l034","ordinal":165602,"en":"Brought at her word."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l035","ordinal":165603,"en":"Fitting it for the hero,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l036","ordinal":165604,"en":"So the mighty man could wear it when wrestling,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l037","ordinal":165605,"en":"She had made it in earnest."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l038","ordinal":165606,"en":"Kanykei, wondrous in every way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b003:l039","ordinal":165607,"en":"For fully six months"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l001","ordinal":165608,"en":"Had it steeped in tanning solution."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l002","ordinal":165609,"en":"She finished all its seams"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l003","ordinal":165610,"en":"And wrapped them with silk."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l004","ordinal":165611,"en":"So he could wear it when strength was needed,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l005","ordinal":165612,"en":"She had intended it for your elder."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l006","ordinal":165613,"en":"Young wives cut it and maidens sewed it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l007","ordinal":165614,"en":"The finest needlewomen sewed it."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l008","ordinal":165615,"en":"The fairy-like Aruuke,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l009","ordinal":165616,"en":"Who had tested five hundred young wives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l010","ordinal":165617,"en":"And capable kinswoman Kanykei"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l011","ordinal":165618,"en":"Had the defective parts unstitched;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l012","ordinal":165619,"en":"They filed down steel"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l013","ordinal":165620,"en":"And poured it in, plate after plate."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l014","ordinal":165621,"en":"It wearied the hand that held it;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l015","ordinal":165622,"en":"A musket ball could not penetrate it,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l016","ordinal":165623,"en":"But lodged in its midst."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l017","ordinal":165624,"en":"It bent when grasped;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l018","ordinal":165625,"en":"When its wearer thrashed in fury,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l019","ordinal":165626,"en":"All the wrestlers"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l020","ordinal":165627,"en":"Lost their holds, one after another."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l021","ordinal":165628,"en":"Embers could not pass through it when firewood burned;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l022","ordinal":165629,"en":"The magnanimous one's kandagai"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l023","ordinal":165630,"en":"Could not be pierced when a cannon fired."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l024","ordinal":165631,"en":"Its waistband was tied securely;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1159:b004:l025","ordinal":165632,"en":"The auspicious kandagai"}]
